# The trained model binary (artifacts/*.joblib) is NOT committed by default — it
# is rebuilt from the committed GDSC data (`python -m model.train`). See AUDIT.md
# item 3 and .gitignore.
#
# If your team would rather VERSION the binary instead of rebuilding it, use Git
# LFS: uncomment the line below, remove `artifacts/*.joblib` from .gitignore, run
#     git lfs install && git lfs track "artifacts/*.joblib"
# and commit. LFS keeps the pointer in git and the blob off the main history.
#
# artifacts/*.joblib filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Keep line endings sane for text assets.
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.csv  text eol=lf
